#ASSERT `s 30(2) the person is guilty of an offence` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30(2) the person is guilty of an offence` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30(2) the person is guilty of an offence` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE
